    'Elixir’s treatment center solution manages the patient journey from pre-admissions to alumni follow-up and is described as designed by clinicians for clinicians, with an emphasis on outcome-based treatment. The intake suite handles everything from initial contact to clinical admission with custom workflows that fit a facility’s processes, while keeping one view of the patient across departments. Features include integrated pre-assessments, real-time census management for facility capacity and placement, digital engagement built on Salesforce CRM, session notes and tracking, dynamic care plans, and utilization review tracking. On the revenue side Elixir includes insurance eligibility verification, clearinghouse integration, claim generation and processing, ERA handling and EOB processing, automated payment processing and payment reminder workflows. After discharge, the patient portal supports alumni engagement with planned contact schedules, community groups and shared resources.',
